sequenceDiagram
 participant G as Gate validator
 participant A as Authority or spare
 participant J as Redemption journal
 participant O as Recovery operator
 G->>G: Verify signature and entitlement
 alt Local authority reachable
 G->>A: Request ID, party, generation
 A->>J: Atomic allowance check and append
 J-->>A: Committed or previous decision
 A-->>G: Decision at matching generation
 else Authority failed
 Note over G,O: Operations lead authorizes recovery; staffed exceptions
 O->>A: Physically fence former writer
 O->>J: Restore and reconcile acknowledged decisions
 J-->>O: Completeness known or unknown
 alt Fence and journal verified
 O->>A: Configure next generation
 O->>G: Authenticated enrollment; persist generation
 Note over G,A: Spare allowlists only updated validators
 G->>A: Redeem with new generation
 A-->>G: Matching generation decision
 else State or fence uncertain
 Note over G,O: Automatic redemption stays disabled
 end
 end
